"}, {"id": "c54a11da-f8c6-41a1-a2f8-9169428b4ff1", "type": "concept", "title": "Price optimization"}], "description": "Gist: Dynamic prices respond to demand, time, inventory, competition, and customer context."}, {"id": "7880c816-ae0d-4fb7-a740-66b377a7f730", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Governance of algorithms", "children": [{"id": "41892762-985e-4713-b851-226adbdb6c85", "type": "concept", "title": "Model drift"}, {"id": "c77206f9-148e-41ff-b315-203e64cbcefb", "type": "concept", "title": "Bias risk"}, {"id": "fc8c45a2-cd92-4e5c-ac12-d4a1e8c49c5d", "type": "concept", "title": "Customer communication"}, {"id": "528c3c62-f707-4378-8f0d-853cbb647083", "type": "concept", "title": "Override rules"}], "description": "Gist: Dynamic pricing must be monitored for fairness, transparency, and unintended outcomes."}]}, {"id": "bc6709e0-da6a-443e-8787-90935f6452f9", "type": "topic", "title": "B2B Pricing, Negotiation, and Sales Enablement", "description": "Equip students to design pricing processes for enterprise selling, discount governance, and value negotiation.", "children": [{"id": "9403be17-72e9-4fb9-8307-e661808c42ed", "type": "subtopic", "title": "B2B value quantification", "children": [{"id": "d32a723a-2591-47c0-9dbc-7ab9a64e5250", "type": "concept", "title": "ROI case"}, {"id": "328e58f5-c862-476b-ad0f-b7b9a22cdba2", "type": "concept", "title": "Total cost of ownership"}, {"id": "5b376586-bfeb-47ba-939e-7a0fabc61f10", "type": "concept", "title": "Economic buyer"}, {"id": "4bf32826-f5fa-47ef-a3a0-34e032945433", "type": "concept", "title": "Use-case value"}], "description": "Gist: B2B pricing depends on quantified business value, procurement dynamics, and buyer economics."}, {"id": "fd0291b5-96a4-4151-b91a-e68b2a2b2ca4", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Discount governance", "children": [{"id": "3548c86d-7a7b-45f9-a870-a479f58ebc3f", "type": "concept", "title": "Discount waterfall"}, {"id": "a46b5127-55f0-4f1d-9461-a7bf2fc26b8f", "type": "concept", "title": "Approval thr